[{:db/id "q-81684/selection/16a581fa08f0266a497c7ca8fdc2a0e3c6e20e83f391961a0391e4b8a2d768b2" :answer/id #uuid "16ac861a-ab7c-53ce-8bd5-5601d38d5f15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v(t)=2{t}^{3}-{t}^{4}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684/selection/cf3495808bf856132abff4f4618237c51a189ec6f266a43ead0085f6bf4aa73d" :answer/id #uuid "193973e4-f5ec-5fe8-97f7-a954ec7508b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v(t)=3{t}^{2}-{t}^{3}-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684/selection/ee17807fc0ac85cf2fbe34b56c11da5107c390f57e3caa2e57325c69a634b9fa" :answer/id #uuid "9df47581-cae3-5199-9399-446ebf23d5db" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v(t)=3{t}^{3}-2{t}^{4}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684/selection/fd0c851d1d75cae00d89c43ed9715b0e4180a7858d13e43fa96449a72d92eb54" :answer/id #uuid "d3d58bf4-572b-5eeb-9eb2-be7662cc1916" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v(t)=2{t}^{3}-{t}^{4}-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684/selection/f5e9d91c8d38127e4fb11c56a15da1fb0a40f5dd2d7b26233a454a086c92644e" :answer/id #uuid "dc333160-e9c2-5c93-b59f-ce794a23b04f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v(t)=6{t}^{3}-4{t}^{4}+11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7d7e64f-ed22-5c5c-8cc9-ad5ae6fbc63a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-81684/selection/fd0c851d1d75cae00d89c43ed9715b0e4180a7858d13e43fa96449a72d92eb54" :answer-field/choices ["q-81684/selection/16a581fa08f0266a497c7ca8fdc2a0e3c6e20e83f391961a0391e4b8a2d768b2" "q-81684/selection/cf3495808bf856132abff4f4618237c51a189ec6f266a43ead0085f6bf4aa73d" "q-81684/selection/ee17807fc0ac85cf2fbe34b56c11da5107c390f57e3caa2e57325c69a634b9fa" "q-81684/selection/fd0c851d1d75cae00d89c43ed9715b0e4180a7858d13e43fa96449a72d92eb54" "q-81684/selection/f5e9d91c8d38127e4fb11c56a15da1fb0a40f5dd2d7b26233a454a086c92644e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-81684" :question/id #uuid "046b01cc-67cf-5c60-952b-af082bd5d5da" :question/math-academy-id "q-81684" :question/problem "A particle moves along a straight line relative to a fixed origin $O$ with acceleration, measured in $\\text{ft}/{\\text{s}}^{2},$ given by the function $a(t)=6{t}^{2}-4{t}^{3},$ where $t$ is the time in seconds. If the particle has velocity $v=-5\\,\\text{ft}/\\text{s}$ when $t=2\\,\\text{s}$, find the velocity (in $\\text{ft/s}$) of the particle at time $t.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find $v(t)$ by integrating the acceleration with respect to time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\int a(t)\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int (6{t}^{2}-4{t}^{3})\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{t}^{3}-{t}^{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine $C$, we use the fact that $v(2)=-5.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5 & =2(2)^{3}-(2)^{4}+C \\\\ -5 & =16-16+C \\\\ C & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity $v$ of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=2{t}^{3}-{t}^{4}-5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81684/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee2920dc-93e1-5595-a751-62ad5e4f3035"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81684"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-350978/field-1/cb69d25ff181714cc9ca0b6b23d79ef3376a7daaaa019653fd5a2390d2c34436" :answer/id #uuid "438fe4b3-62f1-5533-a20c-d8669ccf09e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2t^7+3t^4+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-350978/field-1/9a2964cac56d97075b34017c427c96661bbe70d4328491f90825d3871ea470d4" :answer/id #uuid "aa0f6412-9d9a-5e5f-b235-30bf39102742" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2t^7+3t^4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-350978/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a309ad20-6987-57d0-b45b-abe948c42042" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-350978/field-1/cb69d25ff181714cc9ca0b6b23d79ef3376a7daaaa019653fd5a2390d2c34436" :answer-field/choices ["q-350978/field-1/cb69d25ff181714cc9ca0b6b23d79ef3376a7daaaa019653fd5a2390d2c34436" "q-350978/field-1/9a2964cac56d97075b34017c427c96661bbe70d4328491f90825d3871ea470d4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-350978" :question/id #uuid "1e1638b5-7055-56e8-8524-6658a022f221" :question/math-academy-id "q-350978" :question/problem "A particle moves along a straight line relative to a fixed origin $O$ with acceleration, measured in $\\text{m}/{\\text{s}}^{2},$ given by the function $a(t)=14{t}^{6}+12{t}^{3},$ where $t$ is the time in seconds. Find the velocity $v(t)$ (in $\\text{m/s}$) of the particle at time $t$ given that the particle has velocity $v=310\\,\\text{m/s}$ when $t=2\\,\\text{s}.$\n\n$v(t)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we find $v(t)$ by integrating the acceleration with respect to time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\int a(t)\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int (14{t}^{6}+12{t}^{3})\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{t}^{7}+3{t}^{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine $C$, we use the fact that $v(2)=310.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}310 & =2({2}^{7})+3({2}^{4})+C \\\\ 310 & =304+C \\\\ C & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=2{t}^{7}+3{t}^{4}+6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-350978/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee2920dc-93e1-5595-a751-62ad5e4f3035"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-350978"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351011/field-1/16ad0c2afac2310ac4213e4c147a8ff875d80d039203f9a4d0bd13914017aaff" :answer/id #uuid "caa4a2ee-dbd2-545c-b653-1e69d669e019" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "104" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351011/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "65e9b977-6d14-5d8a-b77c-1273009241ce" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351011/field-1/16ad0c2afac2310ac4213e4c147a8ff875d80d039203f9a4d0bd13914017aaff" :answer-field/choices ["q-351011/field-1/16ad0c2afac2310ac4213e4c147a8ff875d80d039203f9a4d0bd13914017aaff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351011" :question/id #uuid "e948bb7d-f7d3-5c00-b9a6-b51b039f48d4" :question/math-academy-id "q-351011" :question/problem "A particle moves along a straight line relative to a fixed origin $O$ with acceleration, measured in ${\\text{ft/s}}^{2},$ given by the function $a(t)=8{t}^{3}-6{t}^{2},$ where $t$ is the time in seconds. Find the speed of the particle at the moment $t=3\\,\\text{s}$ given that the particle has velocity $v=-4\\,\\text{ft/s}$ when $t=0\\,\\text{s}.$\n\nThe speed at the moment $t=3\\,\\text{s}$ is\n{{field-1}} $\\text{ft/s}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find $v(t)$ by integrating the acceleration with respect to time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\int a(t)\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int (8{t}^{3}-6{t}^{2})\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{t}^{4}-2{t}^{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine $C$, we use the fact that $v(0)=-4.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4 & =2({0}^{4})-2({0}^{3})+C \\\\ -4 & =0+C \\\\ C & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity $v$ of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=2{t}^{4}-2{t}^{3}-4.$\n\nWe evaluate the velocity at time $t=3\\,\\text{s}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(3) & =2({3}^{4})-2({3}^{3})-4 \\\\  & =2(81)-2(27)-4 \\\\  & =162-54-4 \\\\  & =104\\,\\text{ft/s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since the speed is equal to $|v(t)|,$ we conclude that the speed of the particle is $104\\,\\text{ft/s}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-351011/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ee2920dc-93e1-5595-a751-62ad5e4f3035"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351011"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-102693/selection/38350cadc353